    that checkout untouched: not fetched into, not fast-forwarded, not cleaned.
    
    Reconciled at tip a5be9c9: 154 task rows / 286 events, every line parses, no duplicate
    ids, 49 complete / 97 pending / 8 in_progress, boardctl validate RESULT: OK (3
    pre-existing warnings). The seven-class evidence census reports zero findings across the
    49 complete rows. Completion-event coverage is 47/49; CF-034 and CF-041 remain without a
    task_completed event, already recorded by the 01:21 tick and owned by CF-130.
    
    The census grades each row's commit_hash, not the envelope of the verdict it cites, so
    this tick ran that second instrument: 21 verdict artifacts across the complete rows,
    parsed in the tree and ancestry-tested. Exactly one orphan — CF-077's verdict
    (.gitreins/history/2026-11-03/410022a2/verdict.json) names 1dfb58b8, the pre-rewrite copy
    of the fix main carries at 1232f7a0, so its Tier-2 PASS certifies a tree that is not
